      "standardized_narrative": "At 1 January 2021 the Syndicate carried gross claims outstanding of GBP 3,340.2m. During 2021 there was a net prior-year reserve movement (gross) of a release of GBP 67.7m driven by a mix of favourable reserve developments in several classes (notably Cargo, Marine Liability, Commercial Property and certain Reinsurance classes) partially offset by adverse developments in discontinued portfolios (notably US trucking liability and International Casualty). Natural catastrophe activity in 2021 (including Uri/Texas freeze, European floods, Hurricane Ida and US tornadoes) materially affected current-year claims but prior-year reserve movements were a net release.",
      "raw_causal_phrases": [
        "Reserve releases of GBP 23.0 million in 2021 compare favourably to 2020 which saw a strengthening of GBP 12.0 million. Reserve releases were driven by favourable performance in a host of classes, including Cargo, Marine Liability, Commercial Property (driven by prior year cat releases), War, Financial Lines, and Credit.",
        "Adverse reserve development totalled GBP 94.0 million in 2021 compared to releases of GBP 14.0 million in 2020. The strengthening is predominantly driven by US trucking liability (GBP 33.0 million) and International Casualty (GBP 38.0 million) classes, which saw significant deterioration in the year, driven by adverse experience, changes to the development pattern and prior loss ratios.",
        "Movements arising from prior year claims (67.7) 29.1 (38.6)",
        "The Syndicate has recorded net loss reserves (net of reinstatement premiums) of GBP 84.0 million in 2021. This includes exposure to the Uri Texas freeze, European Floods, Hurricane Ida and US Tornadoes."
      ],
